{"version":1,"key":"article:7","content":{"id":7,"title":"远程访问 jupyter","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09970827-1a92-4261-95d2-a2ade08a75bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最近又开始折腾了 jupyter 了，因为实验室的网络环境太差，每次我使用 conda 开启一个新的环境，然后下载一些新的包时会非常的慢，慢我还能忍，问题是经常下载失败，浪费我的时间😭，接着我想到我有一台腾讯云的服务器，我就想在服务器上下载 jupyter，然后远程访问。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"e0f02ee6-499d-4107-856b-856f2e97ccdf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下载 Miniconda"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"906e401b-96a9-409e-9b49-6d3746bbcc7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先需要下载 Miniconda，我没有下载 Anaconda，因为我不需要那么多的包，按需下载即可"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Shell","uuid":"d65e5f9e-f261-450a-a8f8-0f109ce710ef","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f76c6cd8-29f1-489e-8e0e-3a87a027bc3f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"wget https://repo.continuum.io/miniconda/Miniconda3-latest-Linux-x86_64.sh","collabId":"5c259f7f-81ad-49ae-ac7a-c14767487a71","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"22eb6423-1dcb-4a37-9810-7a1e0a52ac23","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b87bd9cb-3dbe-45ee-9470-1fc7734a4788","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果没有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"wget"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"yum -y install wget"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行下载。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"109c7a44-b1b5-4e67-87b4-0fc936b1108d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里下载了一个 shell 脚本，运行该脚本即可自动完成 Miniconda 的下载"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Shell","uuid":"4d4afcc0-0aa9-4096-9b21-3a21e940c129","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f5cfea31-f0df-482c-9e83-244f12092475","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"chmod +x Miniconda3-latest-Linux-x86_64.sh # 添加可执行权限\n./Miniconda3-latest-Linux-x86_64.sh        # 执行脚本","collabId":"0c6b3e44-1128-4138-88db-6d32be27ba98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d6c921cd-f63f-456a-824f-523306d70834","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在下载的期间会问一些问题，回答 yes 即可。安装完毕之后，重新进入命令行，输入"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Shell","uuid":"8f013648-c7a6-46b0-a369-10aaa90f4535","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"db2aecef-d21d-4783-a397-04cc3c4fc007","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"conda -V","collabId":"7813d326-cc44-4cca-ac00-227b3c916c4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"93e5c61f-8566-4cfd-aef4-82cac775579f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果正确输出了版本号就说明下载成功了。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"7236e3e1-272c-4ed9-98ca-8c302b482e3e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下载 jupyter"}]},{"type":"para